<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Flashcard</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f2f2f2;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    .flashcard {
      width: 260px;
      height: 200px;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .flashcard h2 {
      color: #4a4aef;
    }

    .flashcard p {
      color: #555;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="flashcard">
    <h2>💡 CSS</h2>
    <p>O que o CSS faz?</p>
    <p>Ele estiliza e organiza a aparência das páginas web.</p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
